    357 U00bc							;   its whole height. GRP1 objects keep their
    358 U00bc							;   own per-type draw window (ObjHeightTab) —
    359 U00bc							;   their boxes stay PLAYER_HEIGHT-based.
    360 U00bc		       00 10	   OBJ_WINDOW =	16	; GRP1 drawing window rows: the .Line test
    361 U00bc							;   `Y - ObjTop < OBJ_WINDOW`. Every design's
    362 U00bc							;   art + colour rows are sized to this
    363 U00bc							;   (ObjSprites/ObjColorTab, 9 x 16 = 144 B
    364 U00bc							;   each). Growing a design's ART past its old
    365 U00bc							;   12 rows is a per-type art change; the
    366 U00bc							;   window has the room reserved already.
    367 U00bc		       00 16	   PLAYER_SPRITE_H =	22	; player art height (8x22, user design 2026-10-22)
