    484 U00bc							; Hot rock pulse (user rule 2026-10-25): a DIM AMBER partner (hue 2, luma 4)
    485 U00bc							; instead of bright yellow, so the band breathes instead of flashing — and the
    486 U00bc							; phase moved to TickCounter bit 5 (one step per 60-frame second; bit 4 flipped
