   1268  f203							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1269  f203							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1270  f203							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1271  f203							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1272  f203							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1273  f203							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1274  f203							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1275  f203				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1276  f203							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
