   1280  f209
   1281  f209							; --- Jet thrust accumulator while Up is held (cap JET_MAX).
   1282  f209							;     2026-10-22 (user report: a full-speed fall could not be stopped):
   1283  f209							;	 * FALLING (vy > 0): thrust jumps straight to JET_MAX — the jet
   1284  f209							;	   catches the fall in ~10 frames from terminal $0180.
   1285  f209							;	 * from rest / while rising: +1 EVERY frame, so take-off eases in.
   1286  f209							;	 * the old ÷4 ramp gate (EnemyRamP & 3, ~1s spin-up, bugs #31) is
   1287  f209							;	   gone: it kept thrust below gravity for ~32 frames.
   1288  f209							;	 * release -> FLOAT: JetPower takes b7 as the float flag and the
   1289  f209							;	   low 7 bits as a 54-frame countdown ($80|54 = $B6). Phase A:
   1290  f209							;	   gravity-only decel stops the climb in ~0.3s; then Y is pinned
   1291  f209							;	   (vy re-zeroed every frame) for ~0.5s (user retest: the first
   1292  f209							;	   1.0s hover was too long — halved); then the flag clears and
   1293  f209							;	   normal gravity resumes (fall ~0.85s after release). State
   1294  f209							;	   lives in JetPower, NOT
   1295  f209							;	   StepsLeft: StepsLeft is the RefreshEnemyY SWCHB latch's byte
   1296  f209							;	   (title edge-detect contract) and .UpSteps rewrites it every
   1297  f209							;	   rising frame — both clobbered a StepsLeft-based float.
   1298  f209							;	 * Sound is press-gated (SWCHA D4) — buzz starts on the press.
   1299  f209							;	 * +~50B here: absorbed by the pre-pad $F8DD pad slack
   1300  f209							;	   (headroom stays $FC67).
   1301  f209							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1302  f209		       a9 01		      lda	#%00000001	; test D0 (up, after 4x LSR)
   1303  f20b		       24 88		      bit	Temp
   1304  f20d		       d0 25		      bne	.JetDecay
   1305  f20f		       a5 96		      lda	JetPower	; Up held: cancel an active float first
   1306  f211		       10 04		      bpl	.JetRamp	;   (b7 flag) — WITHOUT this guard the
   1307  f213		       a9 00		      lda	#0	;   clear would wipe JetPower every held
   1308  f215		       85 96		      sta	JetPower	;   frame and the ramp could never build
   1309  f217				   .JetRamp
   1310  f217							; HERO feel (user 2026-10-22): a HELD jet catches a fall at once. While
   1311  f217							; falling, thrust jumps straight to JET_MAX, so a terminal 1.5 px/frame
   1312  f217							; fall is stopped in ~10 frames instead of the ~1 s spin-up the old
   1313  f217							; `EnemyRamP & 3` ramp gate needed (thrust stayed under gravity for
   1314  f217							; ~80 frames = more than a room height of extra falling). The ramp only
   1315  f217							; applies from rest / while already rising, so take-off still eases in.
   1316  f217		       a5 94		      lda	vyHi
   1317  f219		       30 0b		      bmi	.JetClimb	; already rising -> ramp
   1318  f21b		       05 93		      ora	vyLo
