   1951  f50c		       b0 0f		      bcs	.CMPDone	; no X overlap
   1952  f50e							; Y overlap: player [RoomY, +11] vs miner [MinerY, +11]
   1953  f50e							; accept iff RoomY - MinerY in [-11, +11]  (add 11, compare 23)
   1954  f50e		       a5 81		      lda	RoomY
