   2938  f945							; --- Cell walk (cell_collision_plan 2.1): test the PF buffers directly ---
   2939  f945							; The ZP rect cache ($CC-$DF, 5-slot limit) is gone from THIS walker: the
   2940  f945							; render buffers PF0/1/2Buf ARE the map (BombMarkWalls punches bomb holes
