   3977  fd24							; DropSpeedTable moved to the pre-pad free region ($F9FB) — post-pad before
   3978  fd24							; the $FDE1 pin was full (bugs.md #1 Hover needs the room). Read is abs,Y, so
   3979  fd24							; its address is irrelevant to DropStep.
