   4443  fe9c							; TallyWork — level-bonus count-up (user spec 2026-10-02): reaching the miner
   4444  fe9c							; freezes the frame (dispatch bypasses input/physics/enemies via DropTarget
   4445  fe9c							; $FE), bank2 TallyEntry adds +50 every 4 frames and writes the coin tone
   4446  fe9c							; (every 200 pts); when TallyTicks hits 0 the done path advances the level
   4447  fe9c							; exactly like the old CheckMinerPickup tail, then rejoins OverscanAudio.
   4448  fe9c							;   Event bits in A (through ReturnPad sta/rts): b0 = add 50, b2 = done.
   4449  fe9c							;   Tail mirrors TitleWork: UpdateBombSound holds the coin (BombSnd>0), jet
   4450  fe9c							;   muted, own INTIM wait -> StartFrame: timer block skipped = frozen scene.
   4451  fe9c							; Lives in the $FE8C LHT..moth fill (bank0 has no pre-pad headroom).
   4452  fe9c							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4453  fe9c				   TallyWork
   4454  fe9c		       20 e6 ff 	      jsr	TallyTramp	; A = event (bank2 TallyEntry step)
   4455  fe9f		       a8		      tay
   4456  fea0		       29 01		      and	#1
   4457  fea2		       f0 05		      beq	.TNoScore
   4458  fea4		       a9 50		      lda	#$50	; BCD +50 per tick (pack is $50 exactly)
   4459  fea6		       20 0b fc 	      jsr	CallPad_AddScore
   4460  fea9				   .TNoScore
   4461  fea9		       98		      tya
